---
config:
  theme: redux-color
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    box rgb(230, 240, 255) Store
        participant Web as Web shop
        participant Orders as Order service
    end
    participant Stock
    Customer->>+Web: Place order
    Note right of Customer: Waits on the confirmation page
    Web->>+Orders: Create order
    loop Each line
        Orders->>Stock: Reserve item
        Stock-->>Orders: Reserved
    end
    opt Notes only
        Note over Orders,Stock: Nothing else happens here
    end
    rect rgb(255, 230, 200)
        Orders-->>-Web: Order id
    end
    Web-->>-Customer: Confirmation
